<doc>Execution phase enriches already existing post-it notes in the target JSON with transcript-based explanations.</doc>
EXECUTION:

Structure for the data mapping = {JSON_SCHEMA}:

<doc>Fill explanations for Free Association post-its using scoped transcript first, then global fallback transcript.</doc>
IF {FREE_ASSOCIATION_START} is not empty:
    Update {TARGET_FILE}.module_FreeAssociation

        For each PostIt in freeAssociation:
            {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {FREE_ASSOCIATION_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
            
            If {SNIPPET} is empty
                {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

            freeAssociation.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.


<doc>Fill Life Cycle pro and contra post-it explanations using capability-specific transcript context with global fallback.</doc>

For each LifeCycleStage in
    {TARGET_FILE}.module_LifeCycle.lifeCycleStage:

    For each BusinessCapability in
        LifeCycleStage.businessCapability:

        {BPC_ID} = BusinessCapability.id

        If {LIFE_CYCLE_START_{BPC_ID}} is defined and not empty
           and {LIFE_CYCLE_END_{BPC_ID}} is defined and not empty:

            {LIFE_CYCLE_TRANSCRIPT}
                = {LIFE_CYCLE_TRANSCRIPT_{BPC_ID}}

            For each BusinessModelArgument in
                BusinessCapability.businessModelArgument:

                If BusinessModelArgument.proArgument is defined:

                    {SNIPPET}
                        = Extract the parts of {LIFE_CYCLE_TRANSCRIPT}
                          where LifeCycleStage.name,
                          BusinessCapability.name,
                          BusinessModelArgument.businessModel,
                          the Pro argument, and
                          BusinessModelArgument.proArgument.note
                          are described.

                    If {SNIPPET} is empty:
                        {SNIPPET}
                            = Extract the parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT}
                              where LifeCycleStage.name,
                              BusinessCapability.name,
                              BusinessModelArgument.businessModel,
                              the Pro argument, and
                              BusinessModelArgument.proArgument.note
                              are described.

                    If {SNIPPET} is not empty:
                        BusinessModelArgument.proArgument.explanation
                            = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct
                              and fluent {LANGUAGE}.

                        Preserve the original meaning.
                        Do not invent topics, reasons, consequences,
                        or assumptions that are not mentioned.


                If BusinessModelArgument.contraArgument is defined:

                    {SNIPPET}
                        = Extract the parts of {LIFE_CYCLE_TRANSCRIPT}
                          where LifeCycleStage.name,
                          BusinessCapability.name,
                          BusinessModelArgument.businessModel,
                          the Contra argument, and
                          BusinessModelArgument.contraArgument.note
                          are described.

                    If {SNIPPET} is empty:
                        {SNIPPET}
                            = Extract the parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT}
                              where LifeCycleStage.name,
                              BusinessCapability.name,
                              BusinessModelArgument.businessModel,
                              the Contra argument, and
                              BusinessModelArgument.contraArgument.note
                              are described.

                    If {SNIPPET} is not empty:
                        BusinessModelArgument.contraArgument.explanation
                            = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct
                              and fluent {LANGUAGE}.

                        Preserve the original meaning.
                        Do not invent topics, reasons, consequences,
                        or assumptions that are not mentioned.


<doc>Fill explanations for Different Views Rated ideas and problem-solved notes with module-first transcript matching.</doc>
IF {DIFF_VIEWS_RATED_START} is not empty:
    Update {TARGET_FILE}.container_DifferentViewsRated.module_DifferentViewsRated
        
        For each workshopItemRated:

            For each PostIt in idea:
                {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {DIFF_VIEWS_RATED_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                
                If {SNIPPET} is empty
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                idea.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.

            For each PostIt in problemSolved:
                {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {DIFF_VIEWS_RATED_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                
                If {SNIPPET} is empty
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                problemSolved.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.


<doc>Enrich each Different Scenarios Rated score post-it with the reason stated in its scenario-specific transcript.</doc>
For each Module_DifferentScenariosRated in {TARGET_FILE}.container_DifferentScenariosRated.module_DifferentScenariosRated:

    {SCENARIO_MODULE_ID} = Module_DifferentScenariosRated.id

    If {DIFFERENT_SCENARIOS_RATED_START_{SCENARIO_MODULE_ID}} is defined and not empty
       and {DIFFERENT_SCENARIOS_RATED_END_{SCENARIO_MODULE_ID}} is defined and not empty:

        {SCENARIO_TRANSCRIPT} = {DIFFERENT_SCENARIOS_RATED_TRANSCRIPT_{SCENARIO_MODULE_ID}}

        For each ScenarioAspectRating in Module_DifferentScenariosRated.scenarioAspectRating:

            If ScenarioAspectRating.explanation is defined:
                {SNIPPET} = Extract the parts of {SCENARIO_TRANSCRIPT} where Module_DifferentScenariosRated.scenario, ScenarioAspectRating.aspect, ScenarioAspectRating.rating, and ScenarioAspectRating.explanation.note are described.

                If {SNIPPET} is empty:
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract the parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where Module_DifferentScenariosRated.scenario, ScenarioAspectRating.aspect, ScenarioAspectRating.rating, and ScenarioAspectRating.explanation.note are described.

                If {SNIPPET} is not empty:
                    ScenarioAspectRating.explanation.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE}. Explain why the rating was assigned, preserve the original meaning, and do not invent reasons, consequences, or assumptions that are not mentioned.


<doc>Fill explanations for Staged Offering Portfolio ideas notes with module-first transcript matching.</doc>
IF {STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_START} is not empty:
    Update {TARGET_FILE}.module_StagedOfferingPortfolio

        For each portfolioItem:

            For each PostIt in note:
                {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                
                If {SNIPPET} is empty
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                note.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.


<doc>Fill explanations for Capability Matrix notes from capability-specific transcript context with global fallback.</doc>
IF {CAPABILITY_MATRIX_START} is not empty:
    Update {TARGET_FILE}.module_CapabilityMatrix
        
        For each capability:
            
            For each PostIt in note:
                {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {CAPABILITY_MATRIX_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                
                If {SNIPPET} is empty
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                note.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.
              

<doc>Fill explanations for Detailed Working Plan note collections across explanation-data and required-resources groups.</doc>
IF {DETAILED_WORKING_PLAN_START} is not empty:
    Update {TARGET_FILE}.container_DetailedWorkingPlan.module_DetailedWorkingPlan
        
        For each workplanItemGroupExplanationData:
        
            For each workplanItemTwoStep:
            
                For each PostIt in note:
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {DETAILED_WORKING_PLAN_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                    
                    If {SNIPPET} is empty
                        {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                    note.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.

            For each workplanItemOneStep:
                
                For each PostIt in note:
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {DETAILED_WORKING_PLAN_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                    
                    If {SNIPPET} is empty
                        {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                    note.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.

        For each workplanItemGroupRequiredResources:
        
            For each workplanItemOneStep:
            
                For each PostIt in note:
                    {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {DETAILED_WORKING_PLAN_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.
                    
                        If {SNIPPET} is empty
                            {SNIPPET} = Extract parts of {WS_TRANSCRIPT} where PostIt.note is described.

                        note.explanation = Rephrase {SNIPPET} according to correct and fluent {LANGUAGE} but do not change the meaning and do not invent topics that are not mentioned.


